OL,3,GNEWSAPrisoners make little library book
OL,4,Aboxes for city
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen wooden, weatherproof book sharing
OL,7,Fboxes have been designed, built and
OL,8,Fdecorated by prisoners.
OL,10,FHMP Peterborough partnered with
OL,11,Fvoluntary librarian Dr Catherine
OL,12,FGalloway and the Cambridge-based
OL,13,Fcommunity charity Abbey People.
OL,15,FThe first one was unveiled outside the
OL,16,Fprison by the Labour MP for
OL,17,FPeterborough, Andrew Pakes, while the
OL,18,Frest will be installed elsewhere in the
OL,19,Fcity.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
